==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*sьrati}}. Related to {{m|ru|сор||[[trash]], [[rubbish]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-срать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|срать|impf|pf=вы́срать,насра́ть,посра́ть|vn=сра́ние<q:nomen actionis>,сраньё<q:nomen actionis instantiae; nomen resultatis>,сра́чка<q:nomen actionis instantiae; nomen instrumenti (as a diminutive of {{m|ru|сра́ка}})><qq:also nomen actionis instantiae of {{m|ru|сра́ться}}>,срань<q:nomen resultatis>,срани́на<q:nomen resultatis>,срач<q:nomen actionis instantiae; nomen resultatis>,сра́ка<q:nomen instrumenti>,сра́льник<q:nomen loci; nomen instrumenti>,сра́льня<q:nomen loci>,сра́льщик<q:nomen agentis, occasional>,серу́н<q:nomen agentis>,срун<q:nomen agentis>}}

# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} to [[shit]] (to defecate)
#: {{syn|ru|га́дить|наложи́ть}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''срать''' кирпичами|to [[shit bricks]], to be extremely angry}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[начальник|Нача́льник]] '''срал''' [[кирпич|кирпича́ми]] [[ка́ждый]] [[раз]] [[когда́]] [[подчинённый|подчинённые]] [[приходить|приходи́ли]] [[на]] [[работа|рабо́ту]] [[с]] [[опоздание|опозда́нием]].|The boss was getting angry as hell every time when employees came to work late.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Срать''' [[не]] сяду [[с]] [[он|ним]].|I don't want to have a deal with him.|lit=I will not shit sitting to next to him.}}
#: {{ux|ru|Не мо́жешь '''срать''' — не му́чай жо́пу|[[if you can't do the time, don't do the crime]]|lit=If you can't shit out, don't irritate your ass.}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|figuratively|impersonal|usually in the infinitive even when translated with a finite verb}} for (someone) to not [[give a shit]] {{+obj|ru|dat<someone> + :на(acc)<about someone/something>}} {{q|idiomatically translated by {{m+|en|[[not]] [[give a shit]]}} with the dative object as the subject}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''срать''' ([[на]] [[что́-либо]])|to not care (about something)|lit=to shit on (something)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Срать''' ему́ [[на]] [[этот|э́то]].|He doesn't give a shit about this.|lit=He would shit on this.}}

